  <page_number>201</page_number>
  <running_head>EVANGELI. SECULI. IV.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Primò</catchword>
    <signature>N 4</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">
      <i>Ergò cum homines defuncti juvabantur</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>oblationibus, precibus, suffragiis, &amp; vivorum,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>erat florens adhuc religio, sincerior doctri-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>na, nihil à principio immutata, &amp;c.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Propositio maior prout Harfcherus</l>
    <l n="6">eam tradit non est Calvini nec est uni-</l>
    <l n="7">versaliter vera, sed secundùm superiùs</l>
    <l n="8">traditas limitationes intelligenda.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Minor falsa est secundùm intellectû</l>
    <l n="10">papistarum, quia oblationes, preces, in</l>
    <l n="11">veteri ecclesia, non pro animabus ex</l>
    <l n="12">purgatorio liberandis, sed alio fine in-</l>
    <l n="13">stitutæ fuerunt, de quo supra diximus,</l>
    <l n="14">&amp; ex veterum monumentis probavi-</l>
    <l n="15">mus.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Probatio minoris, in qua totum præ-</l>
    <l n="17">sidium caussæ Harfcherianæ situm, ad</l>
    <l n="18">quam etiam diligenter perpendendam</l>
    <l n="19">cum obsecratione invitat lectorem, pa-</l>
    <l n="20">rum aut nihil roboris habet, quia ex-</l>
    <l n="21">cepto Augustino, testimonia mera sup-</l>
    <l n="22">posititia producit.</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
</page>
